      "content": "that makes sense. it's like they're being forced to pay for these \"environmental goals\" that don't even seem to help the bottom line for actual producers. do you think there's any real economic argument to be made that these regs are actually helping the economy in the long run, or are they just a way for the govt to impose costs on a specific sector?",
